# Density Compare
# Germanium (Ge) — real density 5.323 g/cm³. equal masses: Germanium vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Germanium Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 11.4mm color: #668f8f at (-20mm, 5.7mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 42.5 g — the water cube is the reference
